    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>祝贺我们顺利来到2️⃣0️⃣2️⃣6️⃣！</span></p><p><span>超可以在此立志本年度《她说》将确保每月一更的基本量，如果有更多内容也将多更，希望大家多期待、多收听啦！</span></p><p><span>本期就是2026的首次更新，主体内容分为【关键词】和【生活篇】，首次尝试期待大家听后分享感受</span></p><p></p><p><span>【本期时间轴】💡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 2026《她说》新计划</span></p><p><span>Part1:关键词</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 明确的规则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 隐形的规则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 如何与情绪共处</span></p><p><span>Part2:生活篇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1389">23:09</a> 《重返狼群》—人的兽性与狼的人性</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2fdzcsRDQbo9eKxLgaUX-MCIqg.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 《都是她的错》—究竟是谁的错</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu4vGmPYg5LXIAnewL23H1O9XBhQ.png"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">31:51</a> 《怪奇物语终季》—不喜欢的感受</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjW9i6JXRvx5_PrzJDKxRB4p3EQQ.png"></figure><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 《爱情怎么翻译》—2026开年最美异性恋</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3cliCUKvB-aTDkDULJe5IAvQcD.png"></figure><p><span>BGM：Freedom—Elayna Boynto</span></p>]]></description>
