  <item>
    <title>10｜过节是场重复的剧本杀，而我只是NPC</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6776a21c15a5fd520e91a04b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6776a21c15a5fd520e91a04b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jan 2025 15:12:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>脱离传统大家族模式的超可以、融合感受重庆台湾两地氛围的芸、深度感受父权氛围的火锅，有着截然不同过节体验的三位，分享了彼此随着成长不断更新的过节感受，以及拥有选择权后所做出的改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>传统固然深刻，但仍需要更新；虽然改变很难，但依然值得尝试。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容较丰富，请整理好情绪再出发哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 新年快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 方言丢失的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 跪着拿钱的小孩儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="651">10:51</a> 家族仪式感中的空虚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 消失的父亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 和朋友重新定义仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">16:29</a> 50%遵守仪式中的剥削</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 怒火中的调停者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 规训之外的逃离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 春节情人节和朋友更幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 和选择与不可选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a>长大的那天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> 台湾人在重庆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3548">59:08</a> 重庆人在台湾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4213">01:10:13</a> 重新定义就可以有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>【链接渠道】</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云/苹果播客：同名</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾BGM：今夜我们就出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家新的一年都收获想要的一切！新年快乐！</span></p>]]></description>
